  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Bonus Action, spend a Favored Enemy use (the module takes it): transform for 1 minute. <strong>Ancient Armor:</strong> +1 AC (+2 at Ranger level 11). <strong>Unnerving Aura:</strong> when you transform and at the start of each of your turns, chosen creatures within 10 ft make a WIS save (your spell DC) or are Frightened until the start of your next turn (the module runs it on enemies). <strong>Prowling Retribution:</strong> when a creature within 5 ft of you damages you or an ally, the module offers an Opportunity Attack against it.</p>",
      "chat": ""
